503925,JMO,"Dear customer care, Saya mau pengkinian data di aplikasi JMO gak bisa, katanya sudah 3x salah masukin data, padahal saya sudah isi sesuai nomor KPJ yang lama, dan disuruh datang ke kantor cabang terdekat, malah di kantor cabang tidak dibantu pengkinian data langsung. Malah disuruh pengajuan klaim secara offline saja. Padahal saya orangnya sibuk, jarak kantor cabang pun jauh. Kenapa hanya dikasih kesempatan 3x saja untuk pengkinian data? Merepotkan sekali.  Terima kasih, Dafiend","Dear Customer Care, I want to invite data in the JMO application, I can't, he said, I have entered the data 3 times, even though I have filled according to the old KPJ number, and told to come to the nearest branch office, instead, the branch office was not assisted by direct data. In fact, told to submit a claim offline only. Even though I am a busy person, the distance between the branch office is far. Why is it only given the opportunity 3x for data collection? Very troublesome.  Thank you, Dafiend",1,2021-09-20 06:37:34,4.0.4,Negative
