507424,JMO,"Setelah update Pengkinian Data jadi mudah sekali coba langsung sukses, kendala sebelumnya di 2/6 langsung di perbaiki, mantap. Sedikit Masukan : 1. SMS Verifikasi cukup lama di terimanya meski jaringan Sim Card bagus, bahkan perlu opsi Kirim Ulang untuk dapet SMS Verifikasi baru, berbeda dengan Verifikasi lewat E-Mail yg langsung masuk setelah di minta. 2. Setelah melakukan ""Pengkinian Data"" jika bisa ada notifikasi ke email terkait sukses atau tidaknya. Sukses Terus JMO.","After the data update, it is easy to try it directly successfully, the previous obstacle at 2/6 was immediately repaired, great. A little input: 1. SMS Verification is long enough in the receipt even though the SIM Card network is good, even need to be sent back to get a new verification sms, in contrast to verification via e-mail that goes directly after being asked. 2. After conducting a ""data minimum"" if there can be a notification to email related to success or not. Success continues JMO.",5,2021-09-14 10:00:38,,Positive
