522998,JMO,"Assalamualaikum wrwb, SOP klaim online pencairan bpjamsostek terlalu kaku, mohon dipermudah lagi persyaratannya: 1. KTP asli 2. Kartu Keluarga asli 3. Cukup nomor KPJ tak perlu kartu fisik 4. Veklaring/surat keterangan kerja asli 5. Cukup Nomor Rekening Bank sesuai KTP tak perlu buku tabungan asli. Yang baca komentar saya tolong lengkapi komentar lainnya, supaya para korban PHK atau habis kontrak, bisa segera mencairkan hak-nya. Saya yakin banyak alasan kebutuhan dan kepentingan uang tersebut.","Assalamualaikum wrwb, soup online claims to disburse BPJAMSOSTEK is too rigid, please make it easier for the requirements: 1. Original KTP 2. Original Family Card 3. Enough KPJ Numbers No need for physical cards 4. VEKLARING/ORIGINAL WORK CERTIFICATION 5. enough Bank Account Numbers according to KTP do not need original savings books. Those who read my comments, please complete other comments, so that the victims of layoffs or exhausted contracts, can immediately disburse their rights. I am sure there are many reasons for the needs and interests of the money.",1,2021-09-02 18:47:42,4.0.2,Negative
