523833,satusehat,"Mohon aplikasinya DIPERBAIKI. Untuk mendaftar akun di aplikasi peduli lindungi menggunakan NIK dan email bisa. Tapi untuk melihat sertifikat vaksin tidak bisa kalau pendaftaran akun tidak menggunakan No. HP. Ketika orang2 di desa2 diminta oleh petugas menunjukkan NO. HP untuk mendaftar vaksinasi, mereka pasti akan MEMINJAM NO. HP TETANGGANYA yg sama2 sedang antre divaksin, karena sebagian dari mereka tidak punya HP. Lalu bagaimana jika orang2 tsb diminta menunjukkan sertif vaksin secara online?","Please improve the application. To register an account in the Protected Care Application using NIK and Email, you can. But to see the vaccine certificate, it can't be if the account registration does not use No. MOBILE PHONE. When people in the villages are asked by officers to show no. HP to register vaccination, they will definitely borrow no. The same neighbor's cellphone is queuing up, because some of them don't have a cellphone. Then what if the people are asked to show a vaccine certificate online?",1,2021-09-12 02:58:38,3.4.3,Negative
