524966,satusehat,"Tolong diperhatikan, biar para penggunanya nyaman ga berasa riweh dgn ini apk. Pertama, untuk bsa login selalu minta kode otp berulang ulang baru bsa masuk, baik dari email maupun nomer telp. Error kah? Kedua, ketika melengkapi data akun. Kenapa selalu tidak bsa untuk memasukkan tgl lahir? Ini sudah berulang kali saya coba tpi tetap tdk bsa. Karena untuk memunculkan QR code akun, harus melengkapi data NIK dan tgl lahir. Gimana mau lengkap kalo data tgl lahir error terus !","Please note, so that the users are comfortable not feeling riweh with this apk. First, to log in, always ask for the OTP code repeatedly, it can be entered, both from email and telephone number. Error? Second, when completing account data. Why does it always not be able to enter the date of birth? This has been repeatedly tried but it still can't. Because to bring up the QR Code account, it must complete the NIK and Born Date Data. How do you want to be complete if the data on the date of birth error all the time!",1,2021-09-11 09:02:06,3.4.5,Negative
