528708,satusehat,"Alhamdulillah dah bisa download lagi. Tips buat yg punya masalah download sama seperti aku, coba tes utk download aplikasi lain di play store. Kalau aplikasi lain juga tidak bisa download, mungkin ada masalah di play store. Caranya buka pengaturan trs pilih play store trs bersihkan cache kemudian bersihkan data. Setelah selesai bisa restart HP. Atau bisa cari di google ""playstore tidak bisa download"". Semoga membantu","Alhamdulillah, you can download it again. Tips for those who have problems with downloading the same as me, try the test to download other applications in the Play Store. If other applications can not be downloaded, there may be problems in the Play Store. How to Open Settings Trs Select Play Store Trs Clean the Cache then Clean the Data. When finished, you can restart your cellphone. Or you can search on Google ""Playstore can't download"". I hope this helps",5,2021-09-09 17:12:03,3.4.5,Positive
