530698,satusehat,"Kenapa banyak kasus data tanggal dan bulan di sertifikat vaksin terbalik? Misal harusnya 8 Oktober, jadinya 10 Agustus. Tidak ada kemudahan untuk koreksi selain harus secara manual (email, telpon), itupun kalau direspon sudah sangat beruntung. Kedua, mestinya 1 orang dengan 2 nomor hp (sangat umum) bisa akses riwayat dan sertifikat vaksin, selama NIK sama. Keunikan akun mestinya bukan pada nomor hp, tapi email (misalnya).","Why are there so many cases of date and month data in the Vaccine Certificate Reverse? For example, it should be October 8, it will be August 10. There is no convenience for correction other than having to manually (email, telephone), and even then if responded is very lucky. Second, 1 person with 2 cellphone numbers (very common) can access the history and vaccine certificate, as long as the NIK is the same. The uniqueness of the account should not be on the cellphone number, but an email (for example).",2,2021-09-09 04:06:35,3.4.5,Negative
