531667,satusehat,"Untuk teman2 yg blm mendapatkan sertifikat.begini caranya. 1.masuk web peduli lindungi. 2.log bagi yg sdh punya akun. Atau daftar bagi yg blm. ( Masuk pake no hp sj) 3.ada tulisan""jika anda sdh vaksin,cek sertifikat di sini"" ( Tulisan ""di sini"" di klik) 4.lengkapi data diri lengkap termasuk tanggal saat di vaksin pertama/ yg kedua jika sdh. 5.terakhir verifikasi dan muncul lah kedua sertifikat nya. Setelah itu baru unduh aplikasinya. Selamat mencoba...👍","For friends who haven't got a certificate. 1. Enter the web care protect. 2. For those who have an account. Or list for those who haven't been. (Enter using the cellphone number SJ) 3. There is the words ""If you have a vaccine, check the certificate here"" (the words ""here"" in click) 4. Complete the Complete Personal Data Including the date when in the first/ second vaccine if it's already. 5. The end of verification and the two certificates appear. After that, download the application. Good luck ... 👍",1,2021-09-08 17:37:09,,Negative
