535792,satusehat,"Utk yg lahir akhir desember, pas edit akun dan pilih tgl lahir, kadang tahun yg nongol di inputan tgl stlh pencet ""oke"" bertambah 1. Contoh tahun 1999, klo pilih tgl 26, 27, 28, 29, 30, 31 desember, stlh pencet oke yg nongol di input tgl berubah jadi tahun 2000, meski tanggal dan bulan sesuai. Thn 2007, klo pilih tgl 28, 29, 30, 31 desember, di input tgl berubah jadi tahun 2008. Gitu pula thn lainnnya, pas input perhatiin thn yg nongol beda engga sm yg di pilih, krn bs gagal pas nyimpennya.","For those who were born at the end of December, when editing the account and selecting the date of birth, sometimes the year that appeared in the input on the point after pressing ""okay"" increased 1. Example of 1999, if you choose the date 26, 27, 28, 29, 30, December 31, after pushing okay that appeared in the input of the input to 2000, even though the date and month are appropriate. In 2007, if you choose 28, 29, 30, December 31, in the input on the date of 2008.",1,2021-10-09 04:38:17,3.4.6,Negative
