538927,satusehat,Aplikasi apa sih ini. Saya baru selesai vaksin. download apk ini untuk cek sertifikat vaksin. Udh masukin NIK dan tanggal lahir. Tetep saja ga bisa. Mau cek barcode juga gabisa karena belom isi NIK sama tanggal lahir. Pas saya isi kok malah ga respon dan kolom tanggal lahir tetap saja kosong.berkali kali saya seperti itu bahkan di hp lain juga. Mau nya apa si apk ini. Untuk sertifikat vaksin juga harus terima otp dari SMS. Udh saya tunggu Berjam jam ga ada yang masuk. Buat apa sih ni apk. Gaguna,"What application is this. I just finished the vaccine. Download this APK to check the vaccine certificate. Udh enter the NIK and date of birth. Still can't. Want to check the barcode also can't because the contents of the NIK have not been the same date of birth. When I filled it up, I didn't even respond and the date of birth was still empty. I was like that even on other cellphones too. What do you want this APK? For vaccine certificates, you must also receive OTP from SMS. I have been waiting for hours no one came in. What is this for APK. Idea",1,2021-09-07 08:23:15,3.4.5,Negative
