543437,satusehat,"Saran, jangan memasukkan lab yang tidak setiap hari kerja dan cepat prosesnya karena ini untuk perjalanan dan pesan tiket pesawat harus menunggu hasil lab. Kebetulan saya tinggal di bekasi dan untuk bepergian ke luar pulau harus pesan tiket sehari sebelumnya agar tidak kehabisan tiket. Sementara hasil lapnya sudah 1 hari belum keluar juga (karena ambil sampel di hari minggu) padahal lab lain bisa di hari minggu selesai 6jam. Lab yangvtidak cepat jangan dijadikan rujukan di aplikasi ini.","Suggestions, do not enter the lab that is not every working day and quickly the process because this is for travel and order plane tickets must wait for the lab results. Incidentally I live in Bekasi and to travel outside the island I have to order tickets the day before so as not to run out of tickets. While the lap's results have not come out for 1 day (because they take samples on Sundays) even though other labs can be finished on 6 hours. The lab is not fast, don't be used as a reference in this application.",3,2021-09-06 06:36:09,3.4.4,Neutral
