544281,satusehat,"Pengalaman tiba di bandara Depati Amir, Pangkalpinang, 25/08 Aplikasi ini tidak dapat digunakan. Scan QR tidak terdeteksi di Bandara itu. Saya diminta download E-Hac lama. Saya menolak permintaan petugas tersebut. Alasan Saya: Pemerintah cq Kemenkes /Kemenhub / Kominfo atau apapun itu TIDAK DAPAT MENGGUNAKAN DOUBLE STANDARD Aplikasi Pedulilindungi dan Ehac. SOAL Aplikasi Bandara tidak mendeteksi ehac pada Aplikasi Pedulilindungi maka itu urusan antar Instansi bukan beban Rakyat. Pahamilah!!!","Experience arriving at Depati Amir Airport, Pangkalpinang, 25/08 this application cannot be used. The QR scan was not detected at the airport. I was asked to download the old e-Hac. I refused the request of the officer. My Reason: Government CQ Ministry of Health / Ministry of Transportation / Communication and Information or whatever it cannot use Double Standard Application of Protected and EHAC applications. The airport application does not detect ehac in the protected applications, it is a matter between agencies, not the burden of the people. Understand !!!",5,2021-09-06 03:27:10,,Positive
