557312,satusehat,"Hi team, terimakasih sudah membuatkan aplikasi ini... Sedikit saran dari saja, terkait fitur tes covid dimana yang muncul adalah 30 hari terakhir. Bagaimana dengan penyintas? Mereka gak bisa di vaksin tapi tidak bisa membuktikan. Sementara kita sama2 tau bahwa sertifikat vaksin seperti sudah menjadi syarat administrasi seperti CPNS. Semoga bisa jadi pertimbangan dalam tim DTO. Terimakasih","Hi Team, thank you for making this application ... A little advice from only, related to the Covid test feature where the last 30 days. What about the survivors? They can't be vaccinated but can't prove. While we both know that the vaccine certificate seems to be an administrative requirement such as CPNS. Hopefully it can be a consideration in the DTO team. Thank You",4,2021-09-03 08:03:59,,Positive
