558474,satusehat,"Banyak yang komen diulasan : Setifikat bekum muncul. Sudah Vaksin ? Tapi pas di Cek di App belum muncul sertifikatnya ? Nih begini cara nya Sahabat... ✨Coba buka Akun kalian di Pojok kanan atas, pilih edit Profil. Kemudian kalian lengkapi NIK dan segala sesuatu yang belum lengkap disitu. Langkah terakhir ""Simpan"". Setelah semua terisi, coba kembali ke menu Sertifikat... pasti sudah tersedia ✨Ingat paatikan NIK tidak salah ya. Semuanya itu bisa diatasi asal sabar bukan dengan emosi ✌🏻","Many commented on the review: Setfators appear. Already a vaccine? But when the check on the app has not appeared a certificate? Here's the way, friend ... ✨ ✨ ✨ ✨ ✨ ✨ Then you complete the NIK and everything that is incomplete there. The last step ""Save"". After everything is filled, try back to the certificate menu ... it must be available ✨ I remember that the NIK is not wrong. All of that can be overcome as long as patience is not with emotions ✌🏻",5,2021-09-03 05:31:25,3.4.3,Positive
