558729,satusehat,"Utk ide dan tujuan pembuatan aplikasi ini sangat bagus namun disayangkan byk fitur blm bisa digunakan, seperti merubah foto profil, kamera scan barcode tdk berfungsi, riwayat atau histori perjalanan melalui E-hac tdk bs ditampilkan. Selain itu panduan perjalanan hanya tersedia dlm bahasa inggris saja, perlu disediakan dalam bentuk bahasa indonesia. Dibutuhkan keseriusan pengembang utk menyempurnakan fitur2 yg telah disediakan sehingga tidak terkesan fitur yg ada hanya utk aksesoris saja.","For ideas and the purpose of making this application is very good, but unfortunately the many features can not be used, such as changing profile photos, barcode scan cameras are not functioning, history or history of travel through e-HAC can not be displayed. In addition, travel guidelines are only available in English, it needs to be provided in the form of Indonesian. It takes the seriousness of the developer to perfect the features that have been provided so that it does not seem to be only for accessories.",2,2021-09-03 04:56:59,,Negative
