560139,satusehat,"Sudah vaksin 1 dan 2, akun sudah dibuat lengkap, tetapi sertifikat vaksin tudak tersedia, padahal secara manual sudah diterbitkan oleh kemenkes RI yang menyediakan vaksinasi covid19. Ternyata tidak ada sinkronisasi dan koordinasi antara aplikasi dengan pihak kemenkes di lapangan. Percuma unduh aplikasi ini, tidak bermanfaat. Belum lagi ketika mengisi tanggal lahir, naudzubillah sangat menjengkelkan, harus mengklik ribuan kali untuk mendapatkan tanggal lahir yang sesuai debgan KTP.","Already vaccines 1 and 2, accounts have been made complete, but the vaccine certificate is not available, even though manually has been issued by the Ministry of Health of the Republic of Indonesia that provides COVID 1919 vaccination. It turns out there is no synchronization and coordination between the application and the Ministry of Health in the field. It's useless to download this application, it's not useful. Not to mention when filling out the date of birth, Naudzubillah is very annoying, must click thousands of times to get the date of birth that matches the KTP.",2,2021-09-02 12:50:16,3.4.3,Negative
