561293,satusehat,Saya nggak tahu ulasan yg banyak ini dibaca atau tidak. Tapi sy ada sedikit pertanyaan. Tidak semua penduduk Indonesia punya smartphone berikut kuota data nya. Kenapa setiap visit suatu tempat diminta untuk scan QR Code area tersebut? Kenapa nggak dibalik. Pengelola area yg melakukan scan QR Code warga masyarakat atau scan eKTP untuk check in area tersebut? Intinya sama2 melakukan perekaman kunjungan. Kalau warga masyarakat gak punya gadget dan kuota data bagaiman?,I don't know whether a lot of reviews are read or not. But I have a few questions. Not all Indonesian residents have a smartphone and its data quota. Why every visit a place is asked to scan the QR code area? Why not reverse. The area manager who scans the QR Code of the community or EKTP scan to check in the area? The point is both recording visits. If citizens don't have gadgets and data quota?,1,2021-09-02 00:28:36,3.4.3,Negative
