563654,satusehat,"Aplikasinya baik untuk kegiatan tracing dan pengontrolan supaya tidak ada lagi double data, tetapi untuk izin mengakes lokasi sebaiknya di kaji lagi, untuk pilihan izin akses lokasi saya lebih suka izin lokasi bila aplikasi dibuka, tetapi aplikasinya tetap meminta izin akses sepanjang waktu. Saya kurang suka soal kebijakan privasi yang ini, karena saya merasa akan terpantau terus lokasi saya dimana","The application is good for tracing and control activities so that there is no double data, but for permission to accept the location should be reviewed again, for the choice of location permit I prefer location permits if the application is opened, but the application still asks for access permits all the time. I don't like this privacy policy, because I feel that I will continue to be monitored where my location",4,2021-08-31 14:20:38,3.4.3,Positive
