565401,satusehat,"Istri saya sudah di vaksin tanggal 18 Agustus 2021, sampai saat ini sertifikat vaksin belum diterima, telepon call center pedulilindungi 119 di ping pong disuruh ke tempat vaksin lagi. Di tempat vaksin katanya data sudah diinput ulang oleh picker dan disuruh hubungi pedulilindungi 119 lagi, sudah telepon call center lagi namun diinfokan data belum masuk. Kenapa pelayanannya seburuk itu? Hanya bisa ping pong buat apa ada call center. Harusnya follow up langsung ke pihak penyelenggara vaksin.","My wife was vaccinated on August 18, 2021, until now the vaccine certificate has not been received, calling call centers protected 119 in Ping Pong told to go to the vaccine again. In the vaccine place he said the data had been re -inputted by Picker and told to contact Pedulilat protected 119 again, already called the call center again but the data was informed not yet entered. Why is the service that bad? Can only ping pong for what there is a call center. Should follow up directly to the vaccine organizer.",1,2021-08-30 15:54:09,3.4.3,Negative
