567286,satusehat,"Kenapa ya, pas saya isi biodata di apk peduli lindungi, pas udh selesai dan klik simpan berkali² ga bisa²? Sampe ke logout sendiri. Tolong di perbaiki lg. Fyi, untuk mengunduh sertifikat di apk peduli lindungi, klik menu home trs klik fitur pasport digital nanti di bagian sertifikat bakalan muncul nama kalian dan klik itu, untuk liat sertifikat vaksinasi atau bisa lewat website di bagian pop up web nya bakalan muncul, klik ini untuk mengunduh sertifikat, kemudian isi data diri,kurleb kyk begitu.","Why yes, when I fill in the biodata in the APK care, protect, when it's finished and click save many times? Until you log out yourself. Please fix it again. FYI, to download the certificate at the Protect Cares Apk, click the Home TRS menu, click the digital passport feature later in the certificate will appear your name and click on it, to see the vaccination certificate or can be through the website in the Web pop up section it will appear, click this to download the certificate, then fill in your personal data, Kurleb Kyk so.",3,2021-08-29 17:25:52,3.4.1,Neutral
