569998,satusehat,Aplikasi blm siap sdh di pake buat syarat. Kmrn suamiku naik pesawat sdh melakukan test PCR tp hasil nya ga muncul di peduli lindungi padahal pihak RS sdh input data tp status nya pending krn server nya down. Akhir nya di bandara juanda surabaya di tolak ga boleh terbang padalah kami ada bukti softcopy dr pihak RS kl sudah pcr dan hasil nya negative. Sampai suami dan pihak RS ribut di bandara eh baru boleh masuk. PERBAIKI DULU APLIKASINYA BARU DI PAKE BUAT SYARAT UTAMA BEPERGIAN. TERIMA KASIH,"BLM application is ready to use for conditions. My husband boarded a plane to do a PCR test but the results did not appear at care of protecting even though the hospital was input data but the status was pending because the server was down. Finally at Juanda Airport in Surabaya, it is not allowed to fly, we have proof of softcopy from the KL hospital and the results are negative. Until the husband and the hospital noisy at the airport, EH, can only enter. Fix the application first and then use it for the main requirements for traveling. THANK YOU",1,2021-08-29 03:16:45,3.4.3,Negative
