572326,satusehat,"Dengan menggunakan satu android sangat ribet, dalam waktu dua menit kita harus menghafal 6 digit code verifikasi yg di kirim ke email. Problemnya adalah kita harus buka email dulu. Saat sudah ada di dalam email itu code blm di kirim ( blm sampe). Sementara count down yg dua menit terus berjalan. Saat kode udah bisa di baca kita harus menghafalnya lalu balik ke aplikasi. Saat balik ke aplikasi sialnya bukan halaman di mana kita hrs memasukan kode, akan tetapi halaman utama aplikasi.....😆😆😆😇😇","By using one Android is very complicated, within two minutes we have to memorize the 6 digit code verification sent to the email. The problem is that we have to open an email first. When it is in the email, the code is not sent (not until). While the two -minute count down continues. When the code can already be read we have to memorize it and then return to the application. When returning to the application, it's not the page where we must enter the code, but the main page of the application ..... 😆😆😆😇😇",2,2021-08-28 00:15:00,3.4.3,Negative
