573132,satusehat,"Untuk yg mau ke mall dan dapet kesulitan pake aplikasi ini aku kasih tips: 1. Kalau kalian ga bisa liat sertifikat kalian di aplikasi, coba kalian buka website peduli lindungi lalu daftar kalo belum punya akun, atau masuk jika sudah punya, lalu check sertifikat dri sana, coba buka2 lagi aplikasinya di hp kalian dan cek pasport. 2. Kalau saat update profil tanggal lahir ga bisa input, update ttl profil dari websitenya langsung, otomatis di aplikasi ke update juga.","For those who want to go to the mall and get difficulty using this application I give tips: 1. If you can't see your certificate in the application, try to open the website care to protect then register if you don't have an account, or enter if you already have it, then check the certificate from there, try opening the application again on your cellphone and check the passport. 2. If when updating the date profile date can not be input, update TTL profiles from the website directly, automatically in the application to update as well.",5,2021-08-27 11:24:51,3.4.3,Positive
