575637,satusehat,"Tidak bisa masuk/log in. Jikalau ini aplikasi resmi yg dekelola dan didanai oleh pemerintah INDONESIA, sebaiknya dibuat dengan baik, jangan samapi jika aplikasi ini diperlukan malah tidak bisa digunakan sebagai mana fungsinya. Jika aplikasi ini akan dijadikan sarana masyarakat yg wajib utk yg membutuhkan nya, maka buatlah sarana/aplikasi yg mampu menunjang tujuan nya, jgn terkesan dibuat dgn alakadarnya, dan jangan menutupi kekurangan aplikasi PeduliLindungi dgn alasan uji coba.","Cannot enter/log in. If this is an official application that is managed and funded by the Indonesian government, it should be made well, do not until if this application is needed even cannot be used as its function. If this application will be used as a means of community that is mandatory for those who need it, then make facilities/applications that are able to support their goals, do not seem to be made with the aladarnya, and do not cover the shortcomings of protected applications for reasons of trials.",1,2021-08-26 08:32:14,3.4.3,Negative
