575753,satusehat,"Sangat informatif dan bermanfaat terutama bagi setiap Nakes dan masyarakat umum. Hanya perlu ditingkatkan khususnya dalam keseragaman sistem dalam koleksi data antara Nakes dan Non Nakes yg telah memperoleh vaksinasi Sinovac 1 dan 2 serta Boster Moderna. Demikian halnya utk yg mendptkn vaksin lainnya. Saya 68 th, sdh dpt Sinovac 1 dan 2 (17-2-2021 dan 17-3-2021) sbg Nakes di RS di Bekasi, tetapi ketika mau booster Moderna, belum bisa didaftar krn dlm PeduliLindungi blm bisa diberikan. Kenapa ?","Very informative and useful, especially for every nakes and the general public. It only needs to be improved, especially in the uniformity of the system in the data collection between Nakes and Non -Nakes who have obtained the Sinovac 1 and 2 vaccination and Moderna boster. Likewise for those who get other vaccines. I am 68 years old, already got Sinovac 1 and 2 (17-2-2021 and 17-3-2021) as a health worker in the hospital in Bekasi, but when you want to booster modern, it cannot be registered because in the protected you can not be given. Why ?",5,2021-08-26 07:38:29,3.4.3,Positive
