575817,satusehat,"BAGI YG BERMASALAH SAMA TANGGAL LAHIR, BACA COMMENT INI!! kalian yang kesulitan isi data terutama tanggal lahir di aplikasi ini, ini caranya 1. Log out dari aplikasi 2. Buka browser website pedulilindungi.id 3. Log in akun kalian disitu 4. Klik ikon log in tadi, yg sdah berubah jadi nama atau foto profil kalian 5. Lalu klik akun saya 6. Perbarui profil, nah disitu isi deh tanggal dan nik yg gk bisa di perbaiki di aplikasi, 7. Simpan. 8. Log in lagi di aplikasi, fix berhasil Terima kasih","For those who have problems with the same date of birth, read this comment !! Those of you who have difficulty filling in the data, especially the date of birth in this application, this is the way 1. Log out of the application 2. Open the Browser of the Pedulilatot.id website 3. Log in Your Account there 4. Click the log in icon earlier, which has changed to your name or profile 5. 8. Log in again in the application, Fix successfully thank you",1,2021-08-26 07:04:50,3.4.3,Negative
