577039,satusehat,Aplikasi nya bagus dan mudah digunakan. Saya vaksin ke 1 tgl 20 Mei 2021 lgs terima SMS di HP jadul saya bhw saya sdh selesai vaksin ke 1 dan sertifikat nya tersedia di assetpedulilindugi. vaksin ke 2 tgl 17 juni 2021 jg sama lgs Terima SMS seperti saat vaksin ke 1. Tgl 25 Agustus 2021 saya download aplikasi pedulilindugi melalui smartphone dan saya periksa di info akun ternyata memang sdh ada sertifikat ke 1 dan ke 2 sesuai dgn tgl saya vaksin. Mantap. Tetap semangat. Jangan lupa 3 M.,"The application is good and easy to use. I vaccine 1 on May 20, 2021 LGS Receive SMS on my old school cellphone that I have finished the 1st vaccine and the certificate is available at AssetPedulilindugi. The 2nd vaccine on June 17, 2021 is the same as the same SMS as when the vaccine 1. On August 25, 2021 I downloaded the Pedulilindugi application via a smartphone and I checked in the account info it turned out that there was indeed a certificate to 1 and the 2nd according to my vaccine. Excellent. Keep it up. Don't forget 3 M.",5,2021-08-25 17:00:25,3.4.3,Positive
