578342,satusehat,"Aplikasi ini mudah di gunakan saya sudah mendapatakn sertifikat vaksin pertama dengan mengunduh sertifikat vaksin di aplikasi ini.. selanjutnya tinggal mencetak menjadi berbentuk kartu.. bagi yg susah mendapatkan sertifikat vaksin jgn lupa lengkapi data & masukan kode verifikasi yg di kirim melalui email.. perlu di ingat ! Kode verifikasi hanya berlaku dlm 2 menit. Kalau sudah daftar tpi msih blm ada tampilan sertifikat vaksin & yg ada tampil ""Terjadi kesalahan"" jgn bingung klik aja ""AKUN""","This application is easy to use, I have gotten the first vaccine certificate by downloading the vaccine certificate in this application ... then just print to be a card in the form of a card ... for those who are difficult to get a vaccine certificate don't forget to complete the data & enter the verification code sent via email .. Keep in mind! The verification code is only valid in 2 minutes. If you have registered, but there is no display of a vaccine certificate & that appears ""an error"" don't be confused just click ""account""",5,2021-08-25 07:18:45,3.4.2,Positive
