579924,satusehat,"Saya sudah vaksin dosis 1di polres perak hari kamis tgl 19 agustus 2021. Tp sampai detik ini data saya belum diinput oleh petugas terkait. Nggak tahu alasannya kenapa. Tp ditelpon, kami disuruh dtg lagi ke polres perak utk memasukan data ulang. Ini maksudnya apa? Kami ini jg pekerja bukan pengusaha yg seenaknya aja bisa mondar mandir utk urusan sertifikat yg seharusnya sdh diinput dlm 3 -4 hari kerja. Khok gini sich pelayanan masyarakatnya? Tolong ditindaklanjuti pak/bu. Makasih","I have vaccinated dose 1 at the silver police on Thursday on August 19, 2021. But until this moment my data has not been inputted by the relevant officers. Don't know the reason why. But on the phone, we were told to go to the silver police station to re -enter the data. What does this mean? We are also workers not businessmen who can just go back and forth for certificate matters that should have been inputted within 3-4 working days. Khok like this, the community service? Please follow up with sir/ma'am. Thanks",1,2021-08-24 19:14:00,3.4.3,Negative
