580263,satusehat,"Awalamualaikum para pembuat aplikasi PEDULILINDUNGI yg terhormat, saya anggi warga negara indonesia meminta agar dtaa saya di perjelas karena saya sudah vaksin tp sertifikat tidak muncul.. jika ingin reting dan apk ini di pakai masyarakat indonesia tolong lah permudah jangan di buat ribet dengan cara harus tlp callcenter dan respon lambat. Trimakasih sebelumnya tp apk ini mengecewakan !","The prelingers of the honorable Dear Pedulilat Protecting Application makers, I am an Indonesian citizen, asking that my DTA be clear because I have a vaccine, but the certificate does not appear ... if you want to re ride and this APK is used by the Indonesian people, please make it easy not to be complicated by having to call callcenter and slow response. Thank you in advance but this apk disappoints!",1,2021-08-24 15:15:54,3.4.2,Negative
