582055,satusehat,"Aplikasi ini menjadi penjara buat orang2 yg tidak bs di vaksin krn sesuatu hal dan buat orang2 miskin yg telah divaksin tapi tidak sanggup beli hp. Sertifikat vaksin tidak berguna saat ingin memasuki gedung/kantor yg menggunakan barcode. Seharusnya aturannya dibalik....rakyat sudah divaksin cukup wajib memiliki sertifikat vaksin (ada barcode didalamnya), bukan aplikasi ini. Lalu gedung/kantor yg scan barcode yg ada di sertifikat vaksin jika ingin masuk/menggunakan fasilitas.","This application becomes a prison for people who are not in the vaccine because of something and for poor people who have been vaccinated but are unable to buy cellphones. Vaccine certificate is useless when you want to enter a building/office that uses a barcode. The rules should be reversed .... The people have been vaccinated enough to have a vaccine certificate (there is a barcode inside), not this application. Then the building/office that scanned the barcode in the vaccine certificate if you want to enter/use the facility.",1,2021-08-24 08:26:53,,Negative
