582627,satusehat,"Dalam pandangan sy pribadi ini pemerintah gak siap, tapi dipaksakan. Hampir seluruh aktivitas wajib menggunakan sertifikat vaksin yg notabene sebenernya gak setiap org mau divaksin. dan ketika masyarakat SDH divaksin Krn jk TDK maka ruang gerak nya unt hidup akan dibatasi akan tetapi kenyataannya sertifikat vaksin tdk jg keluar dan tentu SDH divaksin pun masih terbatas ruang geraknya SBG akibat dr sistem yg gak siap. Kirim email pun gak direspon.","In this personal view the government is not ready, but forced. Almost all activities are required to use a vaccine certificate which incidentally is actually not every person who wants to be vaccinated. And when people have been vaccinated because they are not, the space for life will be limited, but in reality the vaccine certificate does not come out and of course the vaccine is still limited to the mobile space as a result of a system that is not ready. Sending an email is not responded.",1,2021-08-24 06:26:42,3.4.3,Negative
