585883,satusehat,"Saya sudah vaksin ke dua tgl 30 September 2021 kmrn , sertifikatnya sudah keluar. Tapi permasalahannya , data di aplikasi warna masih kuning belum hijau dan tulisannya pun sampai saat ini masih ""sudah vaksin pertama"" yg seharusnya tulisannya ""sudah vaksin kedua"" . Ini bagaimana sih?! Padahal semua informasi sudah diinput dgn benar saat vaksin , data di aplikasi sama data kenyataannya TIDAK SINKRON tolong diperbaiki guna kemudahan bersama , jangan seperti ini. Cheers!!","I have vaccinated on the second 30 September 2021 kmrn, the certificate has come out. But the problem is, the data in the color application is still yellow not green and the writing is still ""the first vaccine"" that should have written ""the second vaccine"". How is this?! Even though all information has been inputted correctly during the vaccine, the data in the application is the same, in reality, it is not synchronous, please improve it for convenience together, not like this. Cheers !!",1,2021-10-06 04:09:47,3.4.6,Negative
