588148,satusehat,"Pastikan data diri sesuai dengan lembaran yg diberikan ketika vaksin. Sebab sepengalaman saya data diri milik saya, utamanya tanggal lahir terdaftar di aplikasi berbeda dg KTP, alhasil sertifikat tidak dapat keluar bila data yg dicantumkan berbeda (petugas vaksinasilah yg bertugas meregistrasi awal data diri). Juga ada pengalaman nama org lain yg terdaftar malah alamat. Jd u/ menggunakan aplikasi ini perlu kesesuaian data diri dg lembar vaksin yg diberikan saat kegiatan vaksinasi dilaksanakan.","Make sure the personal data is in accordance with the sheet given when the vaccine. Because as long as my experience is my personal data, especially the date of birth registered in the application is different from the KTP, as a result the certificate cannot come out if the data listed is different (the vaccine officer is in charge of registering the initial personal data). There is also the experience of other registered people's names. So for using this application it requires the suitability of personal data with the vaccine sheet given when the vaccination activity is carried out.",4,2021-08-23 06:04:54,3.4.2,Positive
