589525,satusehat,"Bagus, sangat membantu. Untuk sertifikat yg blm dikirim via sms, bs lgsg cek dan download di app ini. Sempat kesulitan membuka sertofikat, krn tdk muncul tp setelah direfresh dan dicoba beberapa kali akhirnya muncul juga. Sepertinya pengaruh sinyal yg kurang oke. Dan Mapsnya berguna untuk tau daerah kita/daerah yg dikunjungi Termasuk zona apa dlm penyebaran covid. Sejauh ini info yg diberikan sangat akurat Dan bermanfaat. Terimakasih","Good, very helpful. For certificates that haven't been sent via SMS, you can check and download it in this app. Had difficulty opening the certificate, because it did not appear but after being refreshed and tried several times finally appeared too. It seems that the effect of the signal is not okay. And the maps are useful to know our regions/areas visited including what zone in the spread of COVID. So far the info given is very accurate and useful. Thank You",5,2021-08-23 00:14:50,3.4.1,Positive
