592403,satusehat,"Karena dulu masukin data satu nomer hp untuk 2 orang yg vaksin karna diburu buru ibu petugas administrasi pendaftarannya di tkp vaksin. Kata ibu petugasnya satu nomer hp aja tidak apa cuman untuk pengiriman link download sertifikat, sertifikat pertama tinggal download, sertifikat kedua harus pakai apk peduli lindungi dan masukin data lain lain baru bisa download. Jadi sekarang kesusahan karna 1 data nomer hp dipakai 2 orang. Seharusnya apk dari negara siap dan berfungsi baik, bukan seperti ini.","Because in the past, one of the cellphone number for 2 people was vaccinated because he was hunted by the registration administration officer at the Vaccine TKP. Said the officer's mother, just one cellphone number is okay for sending the certificate download link, the first certificate is just downloading, the second certificate must use the APK Caring Protect and Enter Other Data other can be downloaded. So now it's hard because 1 HP number data is used by 2 people. The APK should be ready and functioning well, not like this.",1,2021-08-21 03:24:45,3.4.1,Negative
