593717,satusehat,"Aplikasinya cukup bagus. Bagi yang sertipikat vaksinnya tidak ada atau belum keluar mungkin karena belum input data no hp di aplikasi. Bisa juga coba login di website dan lengkapi data yg kurang. Saya kemarin seperti itu, setelah data dilengkapi riwayat serta sertipikat vaksinnya muncul dan bisa diunduh. Kalau tetap tidak muncul mungkin karena no hp yg diinput di aplikasi tidak sama dengan no hp yg didaftarkan sewaktu isi formulir vaksinasi.","The application is pretty good. For those whose vaccine certificates do not exist or have not come out maybe because they have not input the cellphone number data in the application. You can also try logging in on the website and complete the data that is lacking. I was like that yesterday, after the data was equipped with a history and a vaccine certificate appeared and could be downloaded. If it still does not appear maybe because the cellphone number inputted in the application is not the same as the cellphone number that is registered when filling the vaccination form.",4,2021-08-19 12:57:35,3.4.1,Positive
