595068,satusehat,"nih aku kasih tau yaa, apk pedulilindungi kan baru di perbarui akhir²ini. jadi agak rumit daftarnya dari yang sebelum di perbarui sampai sesudah di perbarui skrang. yang skrang banyak sistem yang belum di aktifin, jadi itu penyebab sartifikat kamu gak muncul. jadi bukan apk nya yang gak berfungsi. jadi langkahnya kamu daftar terlebih dahulu, kalo sudah kamu pencet akun, kamu aktifin kode QR dulu, baru kamu isi data untuk lihat sartifikat vaksinasinya.","Here I tell you, the protected apk is just updated earlier. So it is rather complicated from the list before being updated until after being updated now. There are many systems now that have not been activated, so that is the cause of your sartifikin not appearing. So it's not the APK that doesn't work. So the steps you register first, if you have push the account, you activate the QR code first, then you fill in the data to see the vaccination sartifikan.",5,2021-08-18 04:48:41,3.4.1,Positive
