595561,satusehat,"Di tgl 17 Agustus 2021 ini saya berkomentar; Agar Indonesia Bisa Kembali Ke Sedia Kala. Covid itu Ada. Percaya tidak percaya. Saya pernah menjadi keluarga yang salah satunya menjadi korban keganasan covid. Covid itu salah satunya pengentalan darah. Coba bayangkan, kalo darah kental dan disertai penyakit lain yg diderita orang yg anda sayangi. Kalau kalian muda dan masih produktif, covid itu pasti dianggap tidak ada. Karena kondisi tubuh dan tidak ada penyakit lain. Jadi anda mrsa tdk kena covid","In August 17, 2021 I commented; So that Indonesia can return to usual. Covid is there. Believe in no trust. I was once a family who was a victim of Covid's ferocity. Covid is one of them blood thickening. Try to imagine, if blood is thick and accompanied by other diseases suffered by the people you care about. If you are young and still productive, Covid is definitely considered not there. Because of the condition of the body and there are no other diseases. So you are not in Covid",5,2021-08-17 11:23:52,3.4.1,Positive
