602735,satusehat,# Spec: Redmi note 9 pro Android 10 (queen cake) # Step: - download apps - register dengan email - login - isi data untuk akun - setelah berhasil saya close aplikasi - kemudian login kembali # Issue: - tidak bisa masuk ke aplikasi lagi terus meminta akses lokasi. Jika saya hapus all data kemudian lakukan ulang login bisa masuk lagi ke aplikasi tapi jika saya close lagi kemudian login kembali hal yang sama terjadi lagi yaitu minta akses lokasi. # Expect: Segera di perbaiki. Terimakasih,"# Spec: Redmi Note 9 Pro Android 10 (Queen Cake) # Step: - Download Apps - Register with Email - Login - Fill in the data for the account - After successfully I close the application - Then login again # Issue: - Can't enter the application again and continue to ask for location access. If I delete all data then re -do the login can go back to the application but if I close again then log in again the same thing happens again, namely asking for location access. # Expect: Repair it immediately. Thank You",1,2021-08-12 05:36:31,3.4.1,Negative
