604178,satusehat,"App ini menurut saya sdh bagus, tapi klu bisa jgn terlalu ribet dgn tgl lahir & email. Saat ini no hp kan sdh teregistrasi dgn e KTP? 1 lg yg masih kurang menurut saya, di app ini kita hanya bisa melihat sertifikasi vaksin diri kita sendiri. Bagai mana klu kita ingin melihat org di skitar kita, apakah sdh di vaksin apa belum. Hanya dgn no NIK e KTP kan kita bisa tahu apakah org tersebut, sdh di vaksin apa belum. Terima kasih.","This app in my opinion is good, but you can not be too complicated with the date of birth & email. Currently the cellphone number has you registered with E KTP? 1 LG who is still lacking in my opinion, in this app we can only see our own vaccine certification. How do we want to see people on our surroundings, is it already in the vaccine yet. Only with Nik e KTP, can we know whether the person is, already in the vaccine yet. Thank You.",4,2021-08-11 06:18:57,3.4.1,Positive
