605672,satusehat,"Saya infokan ke semua pengguna apl ini jika kalian susah liat serti nya, saya cuman mau kasih tau...untuk lihat srti vaksin harus klik alamat yang tertera di pesan sms masuk...dari 1199, setelah itu isi formulir..kalo udah di isi formulir nya pasti serti itu ada lalu kita unduh.. dari hasil unduhan nya itu akan masuk ke apl pedulilindungi...,baru di situ kita bisa liat serti/bisa unduh ke hp kita..melalui apl pedulilindungi. selamat mencoba","I inform all this APL user if you are hard to see the certificate, I just want to tell ... to see the vaccine must click the address listed in the incoming SMS message ... from 1199, after that fill in the form ... if the form is filled out, the form is definitely there and then we download it ... from the results of the download it will go to the application ... good luck",3,2021-08-10 07:24:22,3.4.1,Neutral
