606331,satusehat,"Mau tanya kok sertifikat vaksin buat orng tua saya tidak bisa di cek ya? Apakah krna nomer hp nya pake nomer saya sehingga yg bisa di cek dan di unduh hanya sertifikat saya aja (anaknya). Orang tua saya gak punya hp pas waktu vaksinasi nya jadi pake nomer anaknya. Trus gimana buat kedepannya apakah ada kendala nantinya kalo gak ada bukti sertifikat vaksin? Mohon tanggapannya 🙏🙏 Mohon maaf dikasih bintang 2 dulu, nanti kalo udah ada solusinya saya kasih bintang 5 😊🙏","Want to ask how come the vaccine certificate for my old person can't be checked? Is it because the cellphone number uses my number so that what can be checked and downloaded is only my certificate (his son). My parents don't have a cellphone at the time of vaccination, so using their children's number. Then how to make in the future if there are obstacles later if there is no proof of vaccine certificate? Please response 🙏🙏 Sorry to be given a 2 star first, later if there is a solution I give a 5 star 😊🙏",2,2021-08-09 22:45:46,3.4.1,Negative
