607455,satusehat,"Aplikasi peduliLindungi sama yang versi webnya kok gak sama ya? Saya sudah divaksin yg pertama, pas saya cek riwayat vaksin di Web, ada keterangan sudah di vaksin pertama tapi sertifikat belum muncul. Lalu saya coba download aplikasi ini dan login sesuai data saya yg di web, tapi di riwayat vaksinasi, hasilnya beda kayak di web (tdk ada keterangan sudah divaksin yg pertama), dan tetap sertifikat vaksin yg pertama juga belum muncul. Tolong optimalkam lagi. Terima Kasih","The applications are protected with the web version, how come it's not the same? I was vaccinated first, when I checked the vaccine history on the web, there was a statement in the first vaccine but the certificate had not yet appeared. Then I try to download this application and log in according to my data on the web, but in the vaccination history, the results are different like on the web (there is no information that has been vaccinated first), and still the first vaccine certificate has not yet appeared. Please optimize again. Thank You",5,2021-08-08 23:25:46,3.4.0,Positive
