610255,satusehat,"Mau daftarin vaksin, disuruh coba lagi terus. Sekalinya bisa, pendaftaran yg sebelumnya masih ada, padahal pihak sana yg ga mau nyuntik. Ini mau daftar lagi karena sudah pake surat rujukan lho, malah gabisa. Mau cek sertifikat, bilangnya belum tersedia tapi di websitenya udah ada. Buat apa ada aplikasinya kalau gitu 🥲 Apa apa suruh call center, tapi call centernya sibook teros 🙃 Mohon segera diperbaiki ya, gemes banged jadinya 🙂","Want to register a vaccine, told to try again. Once you can, registration that was previously still there, even though there were those who did not want to inject. This wants to register again because you have used a referral letter, you know, instead. Want to check the certificate, say it is not yet available but the website already exists. For what is the application if so 🥲 What do you tell the call center, but the call center is Sibook Teros 🙃 Please fix it immediately, so annoying it becomes 🙂",3,2021-08-06 12:23:52,3.4.1,Neutral
