610606,satusehat,"Ini aplikasi maunya apa ya? Saya dan istri sudah vaksin tahap pertama. Saya sudah daftar, sudah berhasil download sertifikat. Lalu saya loguot dan mencoba login lagi, malahan yg keluar pesan bahwa nomor HP dan email saya belum terdaftar. Lah padahal tadi saya udah brhasil masuk dan download sertifikat. Lalu istri saya bikin akun disini, sudah berhasil masuk. Tapi sertifikat gak ada, hanya ada pesan SIAP VAKSIN. Trus ini gmna Pak/Bu, ribet amat ya aplikasinya. Tolong jelaskan, jgn robot yg jawab.","What do you want this application? My wife and I have the first stage of vaccine. I have registered, I have successfully downloaded a certificate. Then I loguot and tried to log in again, instead the message came out that my cellphone number and email had not been registered. Even though I had already entered and downloaded the certificate. Then my wife created an account here, had made it into. But there is no certificate, there is only a message ready for vaccine. Then this is this sir/ma'am, it's very complicated. Please explain, don't answer the robot.",1,2021-08-06 09:10:47,3.4.0,Negative
