611631,satusehat,"Vaksinasi ke.1 tgl 9 juli 2021, sy ber.3 dgn istri dan anak lancar dan di kasih back up keterangan sertifikat dr pihak rumkit. Besoknya kami masing2 buat akun di PeduliLindungi, Alhamdulillah data kami ber.3 terinput semua walau tidak bersamaan keluar sertifikatnya. Semoga vaksinasi ke.2 tgl 6 Agustus 2021 dengan registrasi vaksin yang sudah tertera di akun PeduliLindungi bisa lancar tanpa kendala. Terima Kasih atas upaya Pemerintah dalam melindungi rakyatnya dr pandemi ini.","Vaccination to 1 July 9, 2021, Sy Ber.3 with his wife and children smoothly and given back up the certificate information from the Rumkit. The next day we each made an account at the protected pedul, thank God, our data was input. Hopefully the Vaccination of the 2nd Date August 6, 2021 with the registration of vaccines that have been listed on the protected account can be smooth without obstacles. Thank you for the government's efforts to protect their people Dr. Pandemi.",5,2021-08-06 03:33:32,3.4.0,Positive
