611784,satusehat,App nya suka error yah. Pertama install sudah masukin NIK. Sudah keluar surat vaksin saya. Besok-besok nya saya coba masuk ke app. Malah ga bisa.. harus daftar ulang buat masuk app. Sudah saya daftar ulang. Eh di bilang surat vaksin tidak ada.. saya coba masukin NIK. Baru ada. Tapi habis itu error' lagi. Banyakan error' nya. Jadi lebih baik app nya di perbaharui lagi deh. Soalnya ribet. Masa tiap masuk ke app harus daftar ulang terus. Harus masukin NIK terus.,"The app likes an error. First install it has entered NIK. My vaccine letter has come out. I try to go to the App. In fact, I can't ... you have to re -register to enter the app. I have re -registered. Eh, I said there was no vaccine ... I tried to enter the NIK. Just there. But after that error 'again. Most of the error '. So it's better to update the app again. The problem is complicated. The period every time you enter the APP must continue to re -register. Must continue to enter the NIK.",1,2021-08-06 03:15:24,3.4.1,Negative
