614520,satusehat,"Kuedit lagi bintangnya. Buat kalian yang bingung belum dapat sertifikat atau mau ubah no ponsel seperti saya. Coba hubungi 119 di malam hari sekitar habis isya' guys. Menurut saya kita harus sabar, karena CS juga pasti sibuk. Dia melayani seluruh warga Indonesia. Kalau belum ada jawaban dari CS saat menghubungi 119 ditelfon terus aja. Kalau kalian sabar pasti diangkat kok beneran. Kalau ada kendala sama aplikasinya, saran saya sih mending langsung buka websitenya aja yang lebih bagus.","I edit the star again. For those of you who are confused, you haven't got a certificate or want to change the cellphone number like me. Try to call 119 at night around Isha 'Guys. I think we must be patient, because CS must be busy too. He serves all Indonesian citizens. If there is no answer from CS when calling 119, just keep it on. If you are patient, you will be appointed really. If there are obstacles with the application, my advice is better to just open the website that is better.",5,2021-08-03 03:30:34,3.3.6,Positive
