615008,satusehat,"Mau cek sertifikat vaksin, akhirnya install apk ini. Begitu masuk dan milih sertifikat malah masuk ke riwayat dan tiket vaksin. Karena baru tau ini apk jadi saya ngisi semacam form tadi yang ku kira langsung cetak sertifikat. Ternyata malah daftar vaksin lagi 😣. Padahal sudah vaksin 1 tanggal 31 juli kemarin. Telfon 119 juga gak bisa"". Kirim email ke pedulilindungi juga ga dibales. Minta tolong saya harus gimana?. Sudah banyak yang komplain kok ya gak direspon 😣","Want to check the vaccine certificate, finally install this APK. Once you enter and choose the certificate instead goes to a history and vaccine ticket. Because I just found out this APK, so I filled in a kind of form that I thought was immediately printed the certificate. It turns out that even the list of vaccines again 😣. Even though there was a vaccine on July 31 yesterday. Telephone 119 also can't "". Send an email to the protected guard is also not on the bale. Asking for help, what should I do?",1,2021-08-02 07:45:54,,Negative
