615010,satusehat,"Jika Sertifikat Vaksin dijadikan sebagai persyaratan untuk Hal tertentu, mending disuruh Install Aplikasi PeduliLindungi guna mencegah hal-hal yang tidak diinginkan seperti pemalsuan Sertifikat Vaksin, tanpa menyudutkan atau berburuk sangka pada pihak manapun. Harapan nya semoga Aplikasi nya lebih disempurnakan lagi. Terima kasih.","If the vaccine certificate is used as a requirement for a particular thing, it's better to be told to install the protected application to prevent unwanted things such as the forgery of vaccine certificates, without cornering or prejudice to any party. The hope is that the application will be more refined. Thank You.",4,2021-08-02 07:41:53,,Positive
